  "description": "Characteristic continuous monotonic siren tone used in Swedish public warning messages (Faran \u00f6ver continuous ~30 s form). Spoken announcements in the MCF sample are excluded from the signature. Shares the same siren timbre family as VMA; temporal 7s/14s patterning is out of scope for this profile.",
